WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.500
Since 1999, Gallup has asked employed
adults about satisfaction with their

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:14.460
boss or immediate supervisor. The first
time they asked this question, 82% said

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:20.189
that they were completely or very
satisfied. In 2019, a similar 84% gave

00:00:20.189 --> 00:00:25.680
this response. On the 20 occasions they
have asked this question, no more than 7%

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.450
have ever told Gallup they were
completely dissatisfied. Does the boss's

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:35.339
sex matter? Since 1953, Gallup has asked
people whether they would rather work

00:00:35.339 --> 00:00:39.210
for a man or a woman. At the time,
two-thirds said that they would prefer a

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:43.019
male boss, five percent of female, and a
quarter said it would make no difference.

00:00:43.019 --> 00:00:50.429
In 2017, 23 percent said that they would
prefer a man, 21 percent a woman, but 55

00:00:50.429 --> 00:00:55.230
percent said it would make no difference.
Finally, could you be the boss? Do you

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:00.660
know more, or could you do a better job
than he or she could? In a poll from 2017,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.600
38 percent said yes, but 56 percent said
that they didn't feel that way.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:11.520
Do you like your boss? Let us know in our poll.
Also, let us know what other topics you'd

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.780
like our scholars to cover in 60 seconds,
and be sure to like and subscribe for

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.850
more research and videos from AEI.

